"""
Opt-in detection/routing wiring -- the five env-gated hooks.

Every hook defaults OFF and is detect-only: with the toggles unset the
dispatch, voting, middleware, and LLM-call paths behave exactly as
before (no new store rows, identical model selection, no new flags).
With a toggle on, the hook records/flags -- and a broken store or
detector never fails the request or deliberation (fire-and-forget).

Toggles under test:
  BASELINE_TRACKING_ENABLED   -> agent_dispatch_stats rows on dispatch
  COLLUSION_DETECTION_ENABLED -> votes fed to the collusion detector
  SEQUENCE_DETECTION_ENABLED  -> extraction-sequence scan on the sampled pass
  MODEL_ROUTING_ENABLED       -> per-call model selection + one cascade step
  STARTUP_CANARY_ENABLED      -> one-shot canary self-check at startup
"""

